@startuml F1.15-D01-listar-tccs
title F1.15-D01 — Listar TCCs
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "TccController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: abre /tccs
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /tccs?aluno=me
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT tccs
Postgres --> Ctrl: lista
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
note right of WebApp
  Sem _links.novo
  (secretaria cadastra)
end note
WebApp --> Aluno: tabela ou EmptyState

@enduml
